"P2424542903" "If you are willing to help, I have urgent work for you. The Trolls have been using a pair of local caves as storehouses for their Superadine shipments. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could infiltrate their warrens and destroy that Superadine, it would put quite a crimp in the Trolls' drug distribution ring.</a> That means less violence in the Hollows, and a chance for me to finally locate that gateway. Will you help me?"
// AcceptString :
"P1001007569" "Destroy the Trolls' Superadine"
// SendOffString :
"P618923557" "The Trolls will not part with their narcotics easily. You have a long, hard battle ahead of you."
// TaskTitle :
"P3010571352" "<color deepskyblue>The Heart of the Hollows</color>"

