// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2570656289" "Are you familiar with the creatures known as the minions of Igneous? They are most insidious. They disguise themselves as simple rocks, but when approached, they become fearsome monsters. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would like you to go out into Grendel's Gulch and defeat these creatures.</a> The area is deadly enough without them."
// AcceptString :
"P217632905" "Defeat Igneous in Grendel's Gulch"
// SendOffString :
"P1612552267" "Your Paragon City police are already fighting a war on two fronts in the Hollows. The Igneous creatures can only exacerbate that problem."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P976098704" "Defeat Igneous in Gulch"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3112515272" "The Igneous minions still hold Grendel's Gulch in their deadly grip."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3332494257" "You have decreased the number of Igneous minions in Grendel's Gulch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1049964829" "The Igneous are deadly creatures, never forget that. You have made great strides today, but it will be some time before the threat is truly contained."
// RandomFameString :
"P4182684527" "{HeroName} isn't afraid of the Igneous!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3271617387" "I have spent the morning at divination, {HeroName}, and I have uncovered a most valuable secret. I know where the Trolls' leader, Atta, makes his home. It is a cavern deep within the Hollows, where many of Atta's bravest Trolls dwell. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can defeat Atta, the Trolls will have a hard time recovering.</a> <br><br>Atta is one of the few Trolls with any reason remaining. For that reason, he is far more deadly than his brethren. I must recommend putting a strong team together before facing him."
// AcceptString :
"P3032278933" "Defeat the Trolls' leader, Atta"
// SendOffString :
"P1664148105" "In my mind, I have seen Atta's den, {HeroName}, and I must warn you: it is a death trap. Be ready for anything."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2426080114" "Defeat Atta & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3280592863" "As long as Atta remains at large, the Trolls will be a grievous threat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P708788176" "You sniff the air. Superadine, Troll sweat, and a burning scent you can't quite identify."

