// Dialog :
"P3209752805" "One of the mages you defeated spat, 'Come for Sam Wincott, have you? Well, you're too late!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3125888132" "You defeated the Circle and learned the fate of Sam Wincott."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1253393135" "So, the Circle used Sam Wincott's inherent magic abilities to uncover the location of the Cavern of Transcendence. This is bad, {HeroName}. This is awful! As we speak, the Circle is probably moving on the cavern. And Sam Wincott remains in the hands of the Igneous! <br><br>I have a plan. I believe I can use magic to force one of the Circle mages to give up the location of the Cavern. He will not be willing, you understand. But he will help you to get the job done."
// RandomFameString :
"P4129726525" "I hear {HeroName} is on the trail of the Cavern of Transcendence!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P282123971" "I had to use every spell I know, but I managed to get the truth out of those Circle mystics you defeated. Just before the Magmites broke into the Circle's lair and kidnapped Sam Wincott, the mages completed their ritual. They know where the Cavern of Transcendence is! And now I know as well. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you're willing, I need you to stop the Circle's assault on the cavern.</a> You can solve one of Paragon City's greatest mysteries, and rescue Lt. Wincott's long lost son in the process! You only have 90 minutes to deal with the situation. <color orange>In order to reach the gateway, you will need a full team of eight heroes.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2916962664" "Stop the Circle's assault on the Cavern of Transcendence"
// SendOffString :
"P3396272861" "I'm about to reveal to you my biggest secret, {HeroName}. The gateway links the cavern to one other location, but that location is not constant. It is determined by the wishes of the gateway's master. If you can fight your way to the gateway, you will become that master. Then the Circle will be unable to use it for evil."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3922025235" "Unlock the gateway"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2947167808" "We can't let the Cavern of Transcendence fall into enemy hands!"

