// Dialog :
"P2869240224" "The gateway, and Sam Wincott, remain at the mercy of your enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2600043394" "You are the master of the gateway now, {HeroName}. It will obey your commands. No matter what magic the Circle visits upon it, the gateway can never link them to the netherworld. You are a hero to the entire city today, but especially to the Wincott family. Even an old, jaded soul like me can't help but be touched by their reunion."
// RandomFameString :
"P3076855549" "{HeroName} rescued Sam Wincott!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1772548441" "It looks like the Igneous managed to drive the Circle of Thorns away from the Cavern of Transcendence. But if I know those mystics, they won't stop their assaults. If you'd like to go up against them again, I think there's someone who could assist you. You should talk to a Circle mage known as Karsis. Don't worry; he is well under my control. He won't be able to harm you."
// RandomFameString :
"P2167133484" "I heard that {HeroName} almost died in the Hollows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P111059092" "It was difficult, but I have managed to subvert the will of one of the Circle mystics. He will remain under my control long enough to guide you to the Cavern of Transcendence. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please go to him now, {HeroName}.</a> He cannot harm you, though I expect he would wish to."
// AcceptString :
"P2371091953" "Go to Karsis"
// SendOffString :
"P3586755702" "Do not be afraid of Karsis. He is under my control, at least for now."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3166471146" "Speak to Karsis"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1969280652" "Have you spoken to Karsis yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1601826635" "Foolish mortal. Yes, I will guide you to the Cavern, because I have no choice. But I will never forget this slight. Be warned: you will never be free of the Circle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3285113199" "Excellent. As I expected, Karsis is fully under my control. You will have to gather a full team if you expect to enter the Cavern of Transcendence. But at least now you will have a guide."
// RandomFameString :
"P3495029536" "I heard that {HeroName} is fraternizing with a Circle mystic!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3121361219" "Lt. Wincott pulled a few strings around the police department and got you this medal. I'd wear it proudly, {HeroName}. The PCPD really are Paragon City's finest. Being honored by them is a great thing."
// RandomFameString :
"P1386403908" "{HeroName}'s a real hero to everyone working to reclaim the Hollows!"
